        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "Employees are so nice!! I usually don’t like overly sweet desserts and drinks so it was really nice to know that i could adjust the sweetness of the boba tea!! Im definitely coming back :))",
        "time": 1768782977,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "P Kandiliotis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113793071851699669283/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLr5XR2EoYefoyRYMrrRMuwTex0YoSoG0iE3_6k-3SEmoNtUA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Wei Min is the best, very cool guy and best service.  I buy here all the time now.    The amount of flavours and combinations is dizzying...\nI find this place has the best bobba tea anywhere ive had it.",
        "time": 1767035415,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
